sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant F as TransactionForm
  participant API as services/api.js
  participant R as Express (requireAuth, validate)
  participant S as transactionService
  participant C as categories repo
  participant T as transactions repo
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  U->>F: fill type, amount, category, date, description
  F->>F: client checks (amount > 0, category, date)
  F->>API: POST /api/transactions + Bearer JWT
  API->>R: request
  R->>R: verify JWT -> userId
  R->>R: zod transactionSchema
  alt invalid
    R-->>F: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (message)
  else valid
    R->>S: create(userId, data)
    S->>C: findById(userId, categoryId)
    C->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE id AND user_id
    alt category missing / other user's / wrong type
      S-->>F: 400 "Category does not exist" / type mismatch
    else ok
      S->>T: create(userId, data)
      T->>DB: INSERT transactions RETURNING id
      T->>DB: SELECT with category name
      T-->>S: transaction
      S-->>R: transaction
      R-->>F: 201 {success, data}
      F-->>U: "Transaction saved."
      Note over U,DB: Dashboard, budgets and analytics recompute from the<br/>new row on their next request (no cached totals)
    end
  end
